  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "4 is a root of $x^2+p x+12=0$<br />$\\Rightarrow 16+4 p+12=0 \\Rightarrow p=-7$<br />Now, the equation $x^2+p x+q=0$ has equal roots.<br />$\\therefore p^2-4 q=0 \\Rightarrow q=\\frac{p^2}{4}=\\frac{49}{4}$",
    "image": null
